# Convex Google OAuth production
# Put these values in: Convex Dashboard → Production Deployment → Settings → Environment Variables
# Copy this file to a non-example filename, replace every required placeholder, and never commit real secrets.
# IMPORTANT: never apply literal <placeholder> values to a live deployment.

# Convex Cloud & Auth
# Source: Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# Google OAuth Web client ID.
AUTH_GOOGLE_ID=<google-oauth-web-client-id>
# Source: Google Cloud Console → APIs & Services → Credentials
# Google OAuth Web client secret.
AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET=<google-oauth-web-client-secret>
